:name: BBC micro:bit V2 — Week 1 UART
:description: Boot the physical-board Zephyr ELF and show its UART output

using sysbus
$bin?=@build/zephyr/zephyr.elf
$uart_port?=60031

mach create "microbit"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @microbit_v2.repl

emulation CreateServerSocketTerminal $uart_port "microbit_uart" false
connector Connect uart0 microbit_uart

sysbus LoadELF $bin
cpu0 VectorTableOffset `sysbus GetSymbolAddress "_vector_table"`
showAnalyzer uart0
start
